# Personal match-scoring artifacts
#
# The resume body and per-role profiles stay out of git here -- the canonical
# copies live in ../resumes/ and ../profile/, and duplicating them would create
# exactly the drift this consolidation removed.
#
# config.toml and criteria.md ARE committed. They are setup, not narrative, and
# app/config.py treats config.toml as required with no in-code defaults: ignoring
# it produces a tree that runs on the machine it was written on and fails
# validate_setup() on any fresh clone, with nothing to indicate why.
#
# VERIFY WITH `git ls-files scout/profiles` -- never `git check-ignore -v`, which
# exits 0 on a negation match too and so reports success either way.
profiles/*
!profiles/README.md
!profiles/config.toml
!profiles/criteria.md
!profiles/resume.md
